Subject: [PATCH] Use the Zig C backend for Serenity

---
 build.zig          |  39 ++------
 src/bdwgc_stub.zig | 215 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 224 insertions(+), 30 deletions(-)
